  "body": "Sunny, modern and easy-care, this one-bedroom apartment is well positioned within the popular Elementum development.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living area enjoys plenty of natural light and flows onto a covered balcony. A generous bedroom, modern bathroom and secure covered car park complete the package. Perfect for first-home buyers, downsizers or investors looking for a low-maintenance property in a popular coastal location.\r\n\r\n•One bedroom, one bathroom \r\n•Sunny, light-filled living \r\n•Covered balcony \r\n•Secure covered car park \r\n\r\nJust moments from Long Bay Village, cafes, supermarket, walking tracks and the beach.\r\n\r\nOur motivated overseas vendor wants this property sold. Get in touch today to organise a private viewing.",
